  "status_text": "Our bet that NOT gates never save more than five gates at this size is being tested one graph at a time, and so far it survives. On seven 5 by 5 graphs it is now checked that no circuit of at most 5 AND, OR and NOT gates of fan-in two draws them on one-a-side inputs [L-meta-19324, L-meta-19326 among them]; seven more checks of the same kind are open, and the bet itself is still a conjecture [L-meta-19158].",
